  "title": "Nonexistence of an SDS(9,8,1) in C₃²",
  "batch_label": "86",
  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "disproved",
  "scope": "For G=(F_3^2,+), there is no coefficient function a:G->{0,1,-1} with exactly eight nonzero values such that D D^(-1)=7[0]+sum_{x in G}[x], where D=sum_{x in G} a_x[x]. Equivalently, SDS(9,8,1,C_3^2) does not exist.",
